Package: lifewatt
Title: Environmental Justice Indicators by US ZIP Code
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Your", "Name", , "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides ZIP-code-level access to environmental justice
    indicators, including area-average residential electricity prices
    (observed EIA-861 annual and state monthly series with a validated
    forecast beyond the observed window), their year-over-year and
    month-over-month trends, and bill-based price evidence. Includes an
    expected life-expectancy loss view anchored to published national life
    tables, with any life-expectancy translation declared as a sensitivity
    parameter until a sourced elasticity exists, and a synthetic
    life-expectancy estimate built from state mortality rates whose assumptions
    are declared in the output, and ZCTA-level adult health estimates from the
    CDC PLACES 2025 release (crude prevalence with 95% confidence limits for
    the 2023 BRFSS measures).
